  "decision": "Do not train a turn selector from node-budget variants alone. Two extra search budgets produced only three new end states across 54 sampled positions and only one newly favorable terminal label. Retain the optional diagnostic, but obtain genuinely diverse complete-turn candidates before spending shared GPU resources on distillation. No rated agent or browser policy was changed.",
